        "content": "An explicit `Price: 0 USD` is usually set for a task tagged as `Priority: 0 {Regression)` if you want to test it.\r\nWhen there is no price label, by default we do not generate rewards. The behavior can be overridden by setting `requirePriceLabel` to false, and in such case we want `Infinity` indeed.",
